<title>USA: S. Fayette Township SD, Pa., sales postponed.</title>
<headline>S. Fayette Township SD, Pa., sales postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Fayette Township School District, Pa., said Thursday it postponed two bond sales slated for today because the offerings are rate sensitive.</p>
<p>South Fayette was slated to sell a $7.5 million general obligation refunding Series A of 1997 issue and a $2.5 million GO Series B of 1997 issue.</p>
<p>The sales are now slated for the first full week of January.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
